cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the course or the parsrag library, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Persian RAG Academy: a course and library for Retrieval-Augmented Generation on Persian text"
abstract: >-
  A free, project-based course in Persian (14 lessons) on building, evaluating and
  deploying Retrieval-Augmented Generation for Persian text, together with parsrag,
  the Python library the learners rebuild lesson by lesson. Everything runs offline
  with deterministic models; real models are optional.
authors:
  - family-names: Nikookar
    given-names: Samane
repository-code: "https://github.com/snikookar/Persian-RAG-Academy"
url: "https://snikookar.github.io/Persian-RAG-Academy/"
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
keywords:
  - persian
  - farsi
  - rag
  - retrieval-augmented generation
  - information retrieval
  - nlp
  - llm
  - education
